{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792825200, "covers_from": "2026-10-24T07:00:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-24T07:01:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792825260, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-24T07:00:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 70549, "sprite_key": "elephant_business", "district": "nangang", "topic": "市政", "content": "我們四口有小孩低收，如今還無法抽到社宅，因三房最少，然一二房卻最多（市場供應量也最大）是否政策失誤？", "display_name": "南港代表 No.70,549", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-24T07:00:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "queue_number": 70550, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "環境", "content": "台北需有廚餘發酵廠，像台南一樣。\n謝謝撲馬市長", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.70,550", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-24T07:00:23+00:00", "duration_seconds": 5, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 55919, "sprite_key": "turtle_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "其他", "content": "市長帶給我們新希望", "display_name": "大安代表 No.55,919", "mood": "hopeful", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-24T07:00:28+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 14790, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "環境", "content": "現在的台北市政府蔣萬安為什麼要一直砍樹？最好是有好幾千顆樹都生病啦，真得很扯耶！ 把樹種回來！！", "display_name": "信義代表 No.14,790", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-24T07:00:43+00:00", "duration_seconds": 17, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 48746, "sprite_key": "deer_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "觀光", "content": "台北的公廁還是令日本朋友怯步，所以請改公廁的衞生紙都可以直接丟入馬桶宣傳，保持公廁整潔才是觀光第一步", "display_name": "中山代表 No.48,746", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 70550, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.70,550", "district": "wanhua", "is_replay": false, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 55919, "sprite_key": "turtle_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 No.55,919", "district": "daan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"pos